--- a/docs/CUSTOM_MODULES.md
+++ b/docs/CUSTOM_MODULES.md
@@ -68,10 +68,14 @@ sequence. Lower numbers appear earlier. Reference values from built-in modules:
 
 - `0` - Language selection (first page)
 - `5` - Keyboard layout
-- `10` - Prepare (display scaling, theme)
-- `20` - Account creation
-- `40` - Time zone
-- `50` - WiFi configuration
+- `10` - Hostname
+- `20` - Time zone
+- `30` - Disk encryption
+- `40` - WiFi configuration
+- `50` - Updates
+- `55` - Web browsers
+- `60` - Account creation
+- `70` - Appearance (theme, accent colour, wallpaper)
 - `200` - Finished (final page)
 
 Choose a weight value between existing modules to position your custom page
